@EmployeePortal_BE_HostAddress = http://localhost:5035

### Get all employees
GET {{EmployeePortal_BE_HostAddress}}/api/employee
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new employee
POST {{EmployeePortal_BE_HostAddress}}/api/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "salary": 75000,
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "age": 30
}

###

### Get employee by ID
GET {{EmployeePortal_BE_HostAddress}}/api/employee/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###


